    "token_metering.workflowBreakdownSubtitle": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Safe labels when a workflow or runtime provides them"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"作業フローまたは実行環境が提供する安全なラベル"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"작업 흐름이나 런타임이 제공한 안전한 라벨"}}}},
    "token_metering.workflowFocus": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Work Type"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"作業分類"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"작업 분류"}}}},
    "token_metering.workflowInfoDetail": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Work type is a safe reusable label from the runtime or a trusted workflow. If labels are missing, totals, input, output, model, and time range still remain meaningful."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"作業タイプは実行環境または信頼済みの作業フローから来る安全で再利用可能なラベルです。ラベルがなくても、合計、入力、出力、モデル、期間は有用です。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"작업 유형은 런타임이나 신뢰된 작업 흐름에서 온 안전하고 재사용 가능한 라벨입니다. 라벨이 없어도 합계, 입력, 출력, 모델, 기간은 여전히 유의미합니다."}}}},
    "token_metering.workflowInfoTitle": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Work type"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"作業タイプ"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"작업 유형"}}}},
